runCellRanger.sh:

This is a SLURM script for running CellRanger. Config files will need to be created for each set of fastq files. 


Generate_SeuratObjects.R:

This script generates seurat objects for each sample using cell ranger output.


New_Library_Merge.R:

This script merges the Seurat objects from Generate_SeuratObjects into a single object for downstream analysis. 


QC_Filtering.R:

This script takes a merged Seurat object and performs demultiplexing and initial quality control, including doublet removal and standard cell filtering. 

CLEAN_WNN_batch_correction.R: 

This script impletes a WNN framework as well as Harmony batch correction. 

CD4Tcell_Filtering.R:

This script subsets the data to CD4 T cells based on canonical T cell markers. The subsetted data is reclustered.


DEG_Analysis.R:

This script performs differential gene expression, psuedobulked by sample. 


VDJ_Clean_exlude_GS.R:

This script performs analysis on TCR metadata, focusing on clonotypes that are present across multiple tissues. 
